# Repos AI — ML Research Platform

An intelligent machine learning research platform built for researchers to experiment, analyze, and publish findings.

## Features
- **Dataset Explorer** — Browse 20,000+ OpenML datasets or upload your own CSV
- **Model Lab** — Train 23 ML models with single/compare/ensemble/optimize modes
- **Evaluation Board** — Compare models, visualize metrics, generate reports
- **Research Assistant** — AI chatbot that knows your experiments
- **Conference Pulse** — Live upcoming AI/ML conference deadlines
- **Research Frontiers** — Daily AI/ML breakthrough tracker

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | FastAPI, Python 3.11 |
| ML Engine | scikit-learn (23 models) |
| AI/LLM | Groq (Llama 3.3 70B) |
| Vector DB | ChromaDB |
| Dataset Search | OpenML API |
| Web Search | DuckDuckGo Search |
| PDF Reports | ReportLab |

## Setup

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
# Add your GROQ_API_KEY to .env
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

